OL,3,ACentrica boss 'hugely concerned' over  
OL,4,Aimpact of soaring energy bills         
OL,6,FThe boss of British Gas owner Centrica 
OL,7,Fsays he is "hugely concerned" about the
OL,8,Fimpact the expected jump in energy     
OL,9,Fbills in January will have on          
OL,10,Fconsumers.                             
OL,12,FChris O'Shea told the BBC he thought   
OL,13,Fthe number of people unable or         
OL,14,Funwilling to pay their energy bills    
OL,15,Fwould rise when prices go up in the new
OL,16,Fyear.                                  
OL,18,FThe new energy price cap to take effect
OL,19,Ffrom January will be announced on      
OL,20,FWednesday and consultancy Cornwall     
OL,21,FInsight has forecast it will jump by   
OL,22,F#443 a year for a typical household.   
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
