OL,3,ACentrica boss 'hugely concerned' over  
OL,4,Aimpact of soaring energy bills         
OL,6,FThe government has said some households
OL,7,Fwill get #100 to help with bills, but  
OL,8,Fone Citizens Advice adviser said it was
OL,9,Fa "drop in the ocean" while a pressure 
OL,10,Fgroup called for action on "inflated   
OL,11,Fenergy firm profits".                  
